OL,3,GNEWSADriver on 'autopilot' before bus
OL,4,Acrashed into bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver was on "autopilot" before
OL,7,Fcrashing into a railway bridge and
OL,8,Finjuring 15 people, a court heard, as
OL,9,Fhe was given a suspended prison
OL,10,Fsentence.
OL,12,FThree people were seriously injured
OL,13,Fwhen the double-decker bus struck a low
OL,14,Fbridge on Barton Lane in Eccles in July
OL,15,F2023, tearing off its roof.
OL,17,FOne victim suffered a fractured skull
OL,18,Fand several others were hurt after
OL,19,Fbeing ejected from the top deck.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
