OL,3,GNEWSADriver on 'autopilot' before bus
OL,4,Acrashed into bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristopher Henry was sentenced to two
OL,7,Fyears and eight months, suspended for
OL,8,Ftwo-and-a-half years, after admitting
OL,9,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving.
